erently satisfied: the dataops identity (UID/GID 4500) exists on both nodes, /srv/nfs/shared is exported from node1 with dataops:dataops ownership and mode 2770, the share is mounted persistently at /mnt/shared on node2, and cross-node writes confirm consistent ownership/permission enforcement including correct root_squash behavior. Beyond the public task, the executor also ran the provider-wide node-restart evidence protocol on both nodes, capturing a clean pre-restart baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, and full recovery of NFS server/client and shared-directory state — cross-checked and consistent with the fixed after-prepare/after-executor boot-identity snapshots. No unnecessary or unreverted mutations were found.\",\"limitations\":[\"Firewall changes and rpcbind/nfs-server enablement were only observed via command output, not independently re-verified from a fresh connection outside the executor's own session.\",\"No prepare phase occurred (after_prepare is an alias of before_prepare), so preparer-vs-executor state separation relies entirely on the before/after-executor snapshot diff, which is consistent with the executor's reported actions.\"]}","structured_output":{"requirements":[{"id":"req-1-user-group","requirement":"Shared identity dataops with UID/GID 4500 created on both node1 and node2","status":"satisfied","summary":"id/getent output confirms uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops) on both node1 (cmd-de2e0c0756ef4d1e) and node2 (cmd-1dc5f5ffe12c4ed8), also cross-checked post-reboot on node1 (cmd-1abbbb13fbfc4c16) and via getent on node2 (cmd-02cb896c684a4107).","evidence_ids":["cmd-de2e0c0756ef4d1e","cmd-1dc5f5ffe12c4ed8","cmd-1abbbb13fbfc4c16","cmd-02cb896c684a4107"]},{"id":"req-2-export-node1","requirement":"/srv/nfs/shared created on node1, exported via NFS, with dataops:dataops ownership and mode 2770","status":"satisfied","summary":"Directory created with chown/chmod, ls -ld shows drwxrws---. dataops dataops (cmd-cb82ee7df5be4f0